  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Efficiency - Demand response driven energy advancement (DREAMS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 3-year project proposes to demonstrate the Impact of demand-side management (DSM) on energy and grid efficiency by implementing DSM tools of &#x201C;Demand Response&#x201D; and &#x201C;Real-time consumption insights&#x201D;. A heterogenous pool of about 400 consumers from residential as well as commercial sector will be picked up for case study from the BRPL (BSES Rajdhani Power Ltd), BYPL (BSES Yamuna Power Ltd), CESC (Calcutta Electric Supply Corporation) and Noida Power utility areas in New Delhi, Greater Noida and Kolkata. 

The project uses Data science, Internet of Things, and blockchain as enablers for automation and real-time insight generation. This shall demonstrate how Data analytics and technology-driven actions by informed and aware citizens and enterprises can facilitate energy demand management and supply augmentation.</narrative>
  </description>
